  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The RenderTarget class manages an off-screen framebuffer, abstracting complex WebGL resource management for rendering pipelines. It handles the creation, configuration, and destruction of color and depth attachments, supporting both standard RGBA8 and high-precision RGBA16F formats. Its core function is to provide a bound, isolated rendering surface for off-screen operations, with resizing triggering a full recreation of GPU resources."
  },
